| **RDNA 3.5** | `gfx116.27.047.179 I slot print_timing: id  0 | task 0 | n_gen =    433, tg =  47.74 t/s, tg_3s =  48.36 t/s
50`, `gfx1151` | Strix Point/Halo APUs | Back-ported WMMA paths (tuned head limits), dedicated MMVQ tables, fused MoE. |
| **RDNA 3** | `gfx1100` | RX 7900 XTX/XT, 7800 XT | Back-ported WMMA paths, fused MoE (validated). |

